<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.300" end="00:00:09.800" style="s2">Yes, right there. Harder. Oh god. Step</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.300" end="00:00:09.800" style="s2">on me. Harder.</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.000" end="00:00:16.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those skinny little arms,</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.800" end="00:00:16.000" style="s2">one sneeze and you&#39;re gone.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.700" end="00:00:20.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please lie face down, sir. I&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.000" end="00:00:20.600" style="s2">started right away.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.600" end="00:00:35.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh oh oh. OH, I&#39;M BREAKING. I&#39;M ACTUALLY</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.000" end="00:00:35.800" style="s2">BREAKING.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.600" end="00:00:42.000" style="s2">WAIT.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.000" end="00:00:42.000" style="s2">OH. OW. OW.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.000" end="00:00:47.900" style="s2">I SEE THE LIGHT.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.915" end="00:01:02.935" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.000" end="00:01:09.500" style="s2">TAKE IT. YOU SAVED my life.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.800" end="00:01:09.500" style="s2">Take it. You saved my life.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.600" end="00:01:12.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just doing my job.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.100" end="00:01:17.000" style="s2">Leorla, the VIP in room nine wants</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.200" end="00:01:20.100" style="s2">maximum pressure. No matter what he</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.000" end="00:01:20.100" style="s2">screams, don&#39;t stop.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.700" end="00:01:24.300" style="s2">Leave him to me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.300" end="00:01:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember, if he says stop, you&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.100" end="00:01:38.200" style="s2">deep enough. If he cries for help, go</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.600" end="00:01:38.200" style="s2">harder.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.500" end="00:01:50.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.700" end="00:01:50.000" style="s2">The curse is flaring up again.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.300" end="00:02:03.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, I&#39;m here for your massage.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.892" end="00:02:04.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who let you in? Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.492" end="00:02:06.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.792" end="00:02:09.992" style="s2">I&#39;ll get started right away.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.592" end="00:02:09.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the HELL ARE YOU DOING?</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.492" end="00:02:21.092" style="s2">YOU</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.192" end="00:02:21.092" style="s2">GET OFF ME.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.292" end="00:02:28.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SIR, THIS LEG IS WAY TOO TIGHT.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.792" end="00:02:30.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not a leg. Let go now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.192" end="00:02:32.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s twiddling too. That&#39;s not good.</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.092" end="00:02:34.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch any lower. Stop. That&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.092" end="00:02:36.992" style="s2">a leg. Quit touching it. Stop. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.492" end="00:02:38.892" style="s2">touch me there.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.992" end="00:02:41.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No matter what he screams, don&#39;t stop.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.892" end="00:02:44.092" style="s2">Try to relax. Tensing up will only make</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.392" end="00:02:44.092" style="s2">it hurt more.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.956" end="00:02:53.392" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.492" end="00:02:56.692" style="s2">Woo.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.392" end="00:02:56.692" style="s2">Finally straightened it out.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.506" end="00:03:00.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.892" end="00:03:00.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.092" end="00:03:08.292" style="s2">How is that possible?</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.792" end="00:03:12.592" style="s2">You&#39;re blind?</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.692" end="00:03:20.192" style="s2">You&#39;re blind?</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.792" end="00:03:20.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir. But it won&#39;t affect my work.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.592" end="00:03:24.792" style="s2">Sir, your locks are completely tangled.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.392" end="00:03:33.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.092" end="00:03:43.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.292" end="00:03:43.192" style="s2">Another one got caught on my badge.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.592" end="00:03:46.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.092" end="00:03:58.192" style="s2">That&#39;s strange. Why did your locks just</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.492" end="00:03:58.192" style="s2">go limp?</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.592" end="00:04:04.894" style="s2">Perfect. The adjustment worked</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.894" end="00:04:07.294" style="s2">beautifully.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.894" end="00:04:07.294" style="s2">There it is.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.594" end="00:04:12.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liora, the VIP in room nine is about to</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.194" end="00:04:14.494" style="s2">tear this PLACE APART. WHERE HAVE YOU</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.994" end="00:04:16.894" style="s2">BEEN?</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.494" end="00:04:18.694" style="s2">LIORA, the VIP in room nine is about to</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.894" end="00:04:21.094" style="s2">tear this PLACE APART. WHERE HAVE YOU</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.694" end="00:04:21.094" style="s2">BEEN?</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.194" end="00:04:26.394" style="s2">Why are you coming out of room six?</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.194" end="00:04:27.894" style="s2">You brought me into this room.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.394" end="00:04:31.494" style="s2">That&#39;s a lie. The sign said room nine.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.894" end="00:04:31.494" style="s2">You went into the wrong room.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.394" end="00:04:36.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never went into any other room, and I</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.394" end="00:04:38.894" style="s2">gave him the full maximum pressure</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.094" end="00:04:40.894" style="s2">treatment just like you told me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.894" end="00:04:45.194" style="s2">He screamed a lot at first, but by the</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.894" end="00:04:45.194" style="s2">end he was too relaxed to even speak.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.794" end="00:04:51.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open it. OPEN THIS DOOR NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.198" end="00:05:09.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.794" end="00:05:10.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU,</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.818" end="00:05:13.994" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.494" end="00:05:13.994" style="s2">I won&#39;t forget this.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.094" end="00:05:28.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You barged into room six and seriously</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.894" end="00:05:28.194" style="s2">injured a VIP. You&#39;re fired.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.494" end="00:05:35.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mia took me there. She said not to STOP</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.094" end="00:05:37.394" style="s2">NO MATTER HOW MUCH he screamed.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.594" end="00:05:38.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I took you to room nine. You went into</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.394" end="00:05:39.894" style="s2">the wrong room.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.294" end="00:05:40.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Check the security footage. It&#39;ll prove</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.894" end="00:05:42.694" style="s2">what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.794" end="00:05:44.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save it. All I know is you knocked out a</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.694" end="00:05:46.494" style="s2">VIP.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.894" end="00:05:48.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re fired. You&#39;ll be hearing from our</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.494" end="00:05:49.994" style="s2">lawyers about the damage. Take your</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.194" end="00:05:52.094" style="s2">stuff and get out. You can&#39;t blame me</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.994" end="00:05:53.694" style="s2">for your mistake. You&#39;re lucky I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.094" end="00:05:57.694" style="s2">making you pay for the damage right this</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.694" end="00:05:57.694" style="s2">second. Now get the hell out.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.894" end="00:06:03.894" style="s2">Where&#39;s my suitcase?</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.595" end="00:06:12.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s everything I own.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.295" end="00:06:19.695" style="s2">Nyla.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.109" end="00:06:29.895" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.419" end="00:06:31.095" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.895" end="00:06:33.004" style="s2">Finally,</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.095" end="00:06:33.995" style="s2">got you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.004" end="00:06:35.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.995" end="00:06:38.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re offering 100 grand a month. How</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.895" end="00:06:41.895" style="s2">have they still not found anyone?</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.695" end="00:06:43.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The last few didn&#39;t even make it a day.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.895" end="00:06:45.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 100 grand a month?</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.795" end="00:06:47.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last time he wrecked the entire east</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.395" end="00:06:48.795" style="s2">corridor and snapped three stone pillars</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.095" end="00:06:50.495" style="s2">in half. One more rampage and he&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.795" end="00:06:52.195" style="s2">bring the whole manor down. What live-in</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.495" end="00:06:53.695" style="s2">caregiver would take that job?</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.195" end="00:06:55.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget 100 grand a month, even for a</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.695" end="00:06:56.495" style="s2">million, who&#39;d risk their life for a</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.195" end="00:06:59.595" style="s2">paycheck?</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.495" end="00:06:59.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A million dollars?</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.495" end="00:07:17.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What what just flew in there?</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.614" end="00:07:17.595" style="s2">[snorts] Damn it, a human after her.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.795" end="00:07:23.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shirts off.</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.995" end="00:07:40.595" style="s2">60 inches, pass.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.295" end="00:07:52.695" style="s2">80 inches, over spec, hold for review.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.495" end="00:08:04.595" style="s2">Hardness level 10,</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.195" end="00:08:04.595" style="s2">pass.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.670" end="00:08:08.690" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.797" end="00:08:16.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 1,060 pounds, core strength, pass.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.397" end="00:08:24.797" style="s2">7 inches length, pass.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.497" end="00:08:44.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me, is this where you&#39;re hiring a</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.397" end="00:08:44.297" style="s2">live-in caregiver?</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.597" end="00:08:51.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A blind human.</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.197" end="00:08:53.886" style="s2">You really think you can work here?</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.866" end="00:08:53.886" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.697" end="00:08:59.497" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.897" end="00:08:59.497" style="s2">Let&#39;s see you lift one arm.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.697" end="00:09:04.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Strength is part of the test?</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.797" end="00:09:05.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.097" end="00:09:08.497" style="s2">Too bad you won&#39;t even make it past</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.897" end="00:09:08.497" style="s2">round one.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.597" end="00:09:17.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait!</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.301" end="00:09:44.321" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.997" end="00:09:48.497" style="s2">THAT&#39;S HER. GRAB HER!</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.997" end="00:10:13.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHY DID IT GET HEAVIER?</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.777" end="00:10:13.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.247" end="00:11:01.998" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.902" end="00:11:03.298" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.998" end="00:11:04.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.298" end="00:11:07.298" style="s2">THAT&#39;S a fang from one of the air</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.798" end="00:11:10.098" style="s2">snakes.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.298" end="00:11:11.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She ripped out his highness&#39;s fang and</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.098" end="00:11:14.498" style="s2">turned it into a brooch.</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.998" end="00:11:17.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. Don&#39;t let her take a liking to</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.498" end="00:11:17.098" style="s2">our teeth.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.298" end="00:11:26.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Interview&#39;s over. You&#39;re hired. 100</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.598" end="00:11:28.098" style="s2">grand a month.</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.898" end="00:11:29.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I start getting paid right now,</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.098" end="00:11:32.098" style="s2">correct?</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.798" end="00:11:34.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Starting this very minute.</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.098" end="00:11:36.198" style="s2">Sign, then come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.098" end="00:11:37.398" style="s2">His highness&#39;s curse can flare up at any</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.198" end="00:11:39.998" style="s2">moment.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.398" end="00:11:43.798" style="s2">If his snake slash out or his tail goes</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.998" end="00:11:45.998" style="s2">wild, restrain him immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.798" end="00:11:47.898" style="s2">You get a three-day trial. If you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.998" end="00:11:50.298" style="s2">keep his highness under control in three</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.898" end="00:11:52.398" style="s2">days, the contract&#39;s void. You leave</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.298" end="00:11:54.098" style="s2">that same day. No matter how much he</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.398" end="00:11:56.498" style="s2">fights, screams, or tells you to get</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.098" end="00:11:58.998" style="s2">out, do not let go until he&#39;s completely</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.498" end="00:11:58.998" style="s2">calm.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.498" end="00:12:03.598" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. This is what I&#39;m good at.</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.713" end="00:12:09.733" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.898" end="00:12:14.499" style="s2">I I no idea who did this to his</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.399" end="00:12:17.499" style="s2">Highness.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.499" end="00:12:17.499" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave the rest to you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.299" end="00:12:27.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm. [clears throat and snorts] Keep</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.499" end="00:12:27.099" style="s2">going.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.188" end="00:12:39.208" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.199" end="00:12:45.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU!</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.199" end="00:12:47.099" style="s2">WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.499" end="00:12:50.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IS THIS WORKED UP?</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.099" end="00:12:50.399" style="s2">I MUST have found the right person.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.499" end="00:13:01.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; VERA! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.699" end="00:13:01.799" style="s2">GET THIS WOMAN!</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.199" end="00:13:07.399" style="s2">OUT OF HERE!</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.499" end="00:13:11.304" style="s2">GET OFF ME.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.284" end="00:13:11.304" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.214" end="00:13:17.099" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.099" end="00:13:18.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEART rate 180, rapid breathing. His</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.099" end="00:13:21.399" style="s2">temperature is still rising.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.899" end="00:13:22.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get get your face off me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.399" end="00:13:25.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is bad. His heart rate still</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.699" end="00:13:25.199" style="s2">climbing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.099" end="00:13:34.299" style="s2">Easy, your Highness.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.599" end="00:13:34.299" style="s2">Relax and let me handle this.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.499" end="00:13:44.299" style="s2">Hoo. Finally quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.699" end="00:13:53.224" style="s2">Why isn&#39;t he moving?</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.204" end="00:13:53.224" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.799" end="00:13:59.299" style="s2">Your Highness?</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.099" end="00:13:59.299" style="s2">Your Highness, wake up!</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.999" end="00:14:08.199" style="s2">Oh no. He needs rescue breaths now.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.199" end="00:14:12.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.299" end="00:14:24.601" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.954" end="00:14:26.701" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.601" end="00:14:29.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you insane?</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.701" end="00:14:31.214" style="s2">Who said you could kiss me? [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.194" end="00:14:31.214" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.814" end="00:14:33.834" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.801" end="00:14:37.055" style="s2">Get off me first.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.400" end="00:14:39.075" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.055" end="00:14:39.075" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.201" end="00:14:41.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.401" end="00:14:43.660" style="s2">Let me check you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.640" end="00:14:43.660" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.225" end="00:14:47.601" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.901" end="00:14:51.401" style="s2">Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.601" end="00:14:55.201" style="s2">What&#39;s this? It&#39;s soft and cool.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.401" end="00:14:55.201" style="s2">Your Highness, is this your pet snake?</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.201" end="00:15:00.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s not a pet.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.980" end="00:15:03.101" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.601" end="00:15:05.601" style="s2">One drop of venom</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.101" end="00:15:09.901" style="s2">and your heart will turn to stone.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.601" end="00:15:09.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? But he&#39;s adorable.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.425" end="00:15:14.445" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.001" end="00:15:23.301" style="s2">The ointment needs to be washed off.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.001" end="00:15:24.301" style="s2">Take His Highness to the bath in the</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.301" end="00:15:26.801" style="s2">East Wing.</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.301" end="00:15:26.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.835" end="00:15:28.855" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.201" end="00:15:38.201" style="s2">Put me down, you you brute.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.601" end="00:15:49.201" style="s2">STOP. I CAN BATHE MYSELF.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.901" end="00:15:49.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 100 grand a month, this is my job.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.001" end="00:16:03.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it, she can&#39;t swim.</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.651" end="00:16:16.701" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.501" end="00:16:17.901" style="s2">Lyra,</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.701" end="00:16:19.891" style="s2">WAKE UP.</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.901" end="00:16:21.911" style="s2">LYRA.</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.891" end="00:16:21.911" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.821" end="00:16:25.841" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.301" end="00:16:36.502" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.402" end="00:16:39.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SO, [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.502" end="00:16:39.502" style="s2">you&#39;re fully recovered.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.502" end="00:16:48.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. Now, let&#39;s finish your bath.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.202" end="00:16:50.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need. I can do it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.802" end="00:16:53.002" style="s2">Just clean the wounds. Don&#39;t touch</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.302" end="00:16:53.002" style="s2">anything else.</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.402" end="00:16:58.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood. Wounds only.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.902" end="00:17:05.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not hurt there.</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.002" end="00:17:10.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ointment ran down. It has to come</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.802" end="00:17:10.202" style="s2">off.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.102" end="00:17:21.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this pressure okay?</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.202" end="00:17:24.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Barely acceptable.</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.702" end="00:17:28.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll press harder.</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.202" end="00:17:28.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Keep it exactly like that.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.002" end="00:17:39.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now for your hair.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.902" end="00:17:39.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch my hair.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.202" end="00:17:47.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They seem to disagree.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.102" end="00:17:49.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All of you</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.502" end="00:17:49.902" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.762" end="00:18:04.802" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.302" end="00:18:04.802" style="s2">That&#39;s enough. You can stop.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.302" end="00:18:10.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re a lot more honest than you are.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.102" end="00:18:10.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go now.</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.302" end="00:18:20.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guess we&#39;re not done yet.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.602" end="00:18:20.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They don&#39;t need conditioner.</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.803" end="00:18:40.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bath&#39;s over. Your wounds are clean.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.003" end="00:18:44.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You call that a bath?</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.703" end="00:18:50.103" style="s2">All of you, quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.703" end="00:18:55.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Highness, what do you think of the</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.303" end="00:19:00.503" style="s2">new caregiver?</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.703" end="00:19:00.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rough, pushy, no sense of boundaries.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.403" end="00:19:08.603" style="s2">No one asked you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.203" end="00:19:08.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, should I let her go?</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.503" end="00:19:15.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.503" end="00:19:17.003" style="s2">somewhat useful.</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.703" end="00:19:18.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then she stays on for the rest of the</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.003" end="00:19:21.203" style="s2">three-day trial.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.503" end="00:19:21.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do whatever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.403" end="00:19:34.103" style="s2">One more stunt and I&#39;m locking you in a</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.503" end="00:19:34.103" style="s2">box.</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.203" end="00:19:44.603" style="s2">What&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.103" end="00:19:48.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s getting cold. I made hats for them.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.603" end="00:19:48.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My snakes don&#39;t need hats.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.203" end="00:19:57.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect fit. I&#39;ll call you Chip.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.503" end="00:20:03.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said you could name him?</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.938" end="00:20:03.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.103" end="00:20:09.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With that temper, you&#39;re Spike.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.833" end="00:20:11.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.303" end="00:20:14.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take it off.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.703" end="00:20:18.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one&#39;s Doze.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.603" end="00:20:18.003" style="s2">And this one has to be Munchy.</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.903" end="00:20:23.803" style="s2">Then you&#39;re Peenut.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.703" end="00:20:29.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take them,</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.905" end="00:20:29.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; all off, now.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.005" end="00:20:38.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They like them.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.905" end="00:20:40.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They have no taste.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.805" end="00:20:42.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Highness, the family council has</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.305" end="00:20:42.905" style="s2">begun.</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.105" end="00:20:50.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.405" end="00:20:50.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, your Highness.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.105" end="00:21:03.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s late.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.705" end="00:21:05.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only by a minute.</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.605" end="00:21:08.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s on probation. She should be on</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.605" end="00:21:08.005" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.705" end="00:21:17.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, aren&#39;t you affectionate today?</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.405" end="00:21:20.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get to work.</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.159" end="00:21:27.144" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.124" end="00:21:27.144" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.005" end="00:21:33.805" style="s2">Why did you stop?</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.205" end="00:21:33.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today&#39;s treatment is finished.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.005" end="00:21:41.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My heart rate seems off.</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.534" end="00:21:41.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.905" end="00:21:55.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is getting faster.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.105" end="00:21:57.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We may need to keep monitoring it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.255" end="00:21:57.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.505" end="00:22:14.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who gave you permission to move that?</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.706" end="00:22:44.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did the estate get remodeled?</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.106" end="00:22:47.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I simply refused to replace a third set</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.306" end="00:22:47.106" style="s2">of vases.</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.206" end="00:23:05.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Highness?</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.706" end="00:23:10.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t call for you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.906" end="00:23:12.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vera said if you&#39;re still awake this</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.506" end="00:23:14.306" style="s2">late, it&#39;s part of my job to check on</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.106" end="00:23:14.306" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.006" end="00:23:26.006" style="s2">This room sounds enormous.</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.406" end="00:23:28.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s an old ballroom.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.006" end="00:23:32.106" style="s2">No one&#39;s used it in years.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.706" end="00:23:32.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are you here alone?</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.206" end="00:23:37.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They wouldn&#39;t stop pestering me until I</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.706" end="00:23:37.906" style="s2">put on a record.</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.436" end="00:23:39.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.906" end="00:23:39.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t know they were so picky about</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.106" end="00:23:42.906" style="s2">music.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.706" end="00:23:42.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring no [singing] stars.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.406" end="00:23:51.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s something on the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.706" end="00:23:52.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my tail.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.506" end="00:23:56.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.706" end="00:23:56.406" style="s2">It catches people all on its own.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.106" end="00:24:01.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was a reflex. Nothing more.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.206" end="00:24:07.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your reflexes are a lot more honest than</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.306" end="00:24:07.906" style="s2">you are.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.006" end="00:24:10.806" style="s2">What are they doing?</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.706" end="00:24:14.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mutiny.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.606" end="00:24:17.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.906" end="00:24:19.906" style="s2">They want us to dance?</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.306" end="00:24:22.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely not.</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.906" end="00:24:23.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never danced before.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.106" end="00:24:25.806" style="s2">Have you, your Highness?</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.706" end="00:24:27.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.806" end="00:24:30.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Highness won first place at the</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.306" end="00:24:32.807" style="s2">Royal Ball when he was seven.</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.207" end="00:24:34.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First place at seven? That&#39;s impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.807" end="00:24:38.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was a long time ago.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.707" end="00:24:40.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So now you&#39;re afraid to dance?</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.107" end="00:24:44.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Step on my tail and the dance ends.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.908" end="00:24:44.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then just tell me when I do.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.107" end="00:24:51.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Follow my lead, left foot forward.</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.707" end="00:24:53.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I step on your tail?</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.417" end="00:24:56.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.707" end="00:24:56.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.312" end="00:25:02.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.707" end="00:25:05.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your voice says otherwise.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.507" end="00:25:05.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep dancing.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.408" end="00:25:10.908" style="s2">Right foot back half a step.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.607" end="00:25:13.408" style="s2">Now turn</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.908" end="00:25:13.408" style="s2">slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.377" end="00:25:16.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.507" end="00:25:22.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re back up to 180.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.307" end="00:25:23.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You counted wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.408" end="00:25:25.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should we stop and check?</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.507" end="00:25:26.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.207" end="00:25:27.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your caregiver. I have to be</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.507" end="00:25:29.908" style="s2">thorough.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.007" end="00:25:32.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not right now.</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.908" end="00:25:35.307" style="s2">Right now, you&#39;re not my caregiver.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.307" end="00:25:35.307" style="s2">You&#39;re my dance partner.</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.507" end="00:25:43.307" style="s2">Your Highness,</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.007" end="00:25:44.307" style="s2">are you looking at me?</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.307" end="00:25:45.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.307" end="00:25:48.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then [snorts] why have all your snakes</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.408" end="00:25:48.207" style="s2">gone so quiet?</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.332" end="00:25:56.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.207" end="00:26:02.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like he wants a different song.</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.707" end="00:26:02.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough dancing for tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.707" end="00:26:09.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then same time tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.707" end="00:26:09.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm. We&#39;ll see how you behave.</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.307" end="00:26:13.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your tail already said yes.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.908" end="00:26:23.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hawthorn, Prince Lucian will arrive</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.908" end="00:26:23.107" style="s2">at the estate tomorrow morning.</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.007" end="00:26:31.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this really my fearsome older</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.607" end="00:26:32.909" style="s2">brother?</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.509" end="00:26:34.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucian.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.909" end="00:26:36.209" style="s2">No one told me you were coming.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.609" end="00:26:39.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only came to see how much longer you</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.209" end="00:26:43.209" style="s2">have left. The crown prince turned into</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.109" end="00:26:43.209" style="s2">a petting zoo. How touching.</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.409" end="00:26:46.709" style="s2">So you&#39;re the new human caregiver.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.309" end="00:26:47.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liara.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.709" end="00:26:50.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucian,</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.809" end="00:26:53.609" style="s2">Everon&#39;s only brother.</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.109" end="00:26:53.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liara, don&#39;t touch him.</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.509" end="00:27:09.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does everyone in your family kneel when</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.009" end="00:27:09.709" style="s2">they meet someone?</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.909" end="00:27:16.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.309" end="00:27:19.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, I thought you weren&#39;t done with</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.609" end="00:27:19.209" style="s2">the handshake.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.509" end="00:27:24.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still laughing, brother?</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.009" end="00:27:30.909" style="s2">The petrification marks have reached</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.609" end="00:27:30.909" style="s2">your heart scale, haven&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.009" end="00:27:35.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What marks?</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.109" end="00:27:35.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He didn&#39;t tell you?</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.709" end="00:27:41.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.509" end="00:27:44.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every time he uses his petrifying gaze,</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.209" end="00:27:45.609" style="s2">more of him turns to stone.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.009" end="00:27:47.409" style="s2">Once the marks reach his heart, your</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.609" end="00:27:48.959" style="s2">crown prince will be nothing but a</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.409" end="00:27:50.979" style="s2">statue.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.959" end="00:27:50.979" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.509" end="00:27:57.209" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t count on a third paycheck.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.409" end="00:28:02.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is he telling the truth?</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.909" end="00:28:05.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The whole family knows. You&#39;re the only</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.709" end="00:28:08.309" style="s2">one who doesn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.709" end="00:28:12.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I SAID SHUT UP.</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.309" end="00:28:12.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LOOK AT ME. [gasps] BREATHE SLOWLY.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.194" end="00:28:15.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.009" end="00:28:18.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU MEAN to tell me it takes a human to</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.609" end="00:28:20.309" style="s2">keep you under control?</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.309" end="00:28:22.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He hasn&#39;t turned to stone yet.</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.309" end="00:28:22.909" style="s2">Your heart turned to stone a long time</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.309" end="00:28:24.409" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.909" end="00:28:25.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re only staying for the 100 grand a</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.409" end="00:28:27.709" style="s2">month, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.509" end="00:28:29.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course the money matters.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.709" end="00:28:33.810" style="s2">But my work isn&#39;t done.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.609" end="00:28:33.810" style="s2">No one gets to say he&#39;s beyond saving.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.210" end="00:28:41.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see how long you stay by his side.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.610" end="00:28:44.310" style="s2">You can go.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.810" end="00:28:47.910" style="s2">I don&#39;t need your pity.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.610" end="00:28:52.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Loosen your collar.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.910" end="00:28:55.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.010" end="00:28:55.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finishing my examination.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.010" end="00:29:05.810" style="s2">Does it hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.010" end="00:29:05.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m used to it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.710" end="00:29:10.710" style="s2">No one can break this curse.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.910" end="00:29:13.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time,</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.710" end="00:29:13.710" style="s2">will you let me help you?</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.010" end="00:29:23.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t regret it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.110" end="00:29:24.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t walk away from a job unfinished.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.310" end="00:29:27.310" style="s2">The way to break the curse may be in</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.910" end="00:29:27.310" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.010" end="00:29:36.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not even royal blood can open it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.210" end="00:29:42.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A royal Medusa fang is the key.</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.510" end="00:29:53.310" style="s2">The serpent&#39;s eye core,</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.510" end="00:29:53.310" style="s2">the source of the royal family&#39;s power.</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.110" end="00:29:57.610" style="s2">The more he uses the power, the faster</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.010" end="00:29:58.710" style="s2">the petrification spreads.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.610" end="00:30:01.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the price of inheriting the</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.710" end="00:30:01.110" style="s2">throne.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.610" end="00:30:07.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If inheriting the throne costs your</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.410" end="00:30:07.810" style="s2">life, what kind of inheritance is that?</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.510" end="00:30:12.110" style="s2">It says how to break the curse.</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.010" end="00:30:16.910" style="s2">The heir must willingly give up the</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.810" end="00:30:19.210" style="s2">petrifying glissed.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.910" end="00:30:22.010" style="s2">He also needs a human who&#39;s immune to</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.210" end="00:30:23.710" style="s2">petrification, petrification.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.010" end="00:30:26.710" style="s2">Someone who can bring him back when he</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.710" end="00:30:29.010" style="s2">completely loses control.</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.710" end="00:30:30.510" style="s2">Then, at the altar,</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.010" end="00:30:31.210" style="s2">the stone shell beneath his heart scale</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.510" end="00:30:32.910" style="s2">must be broken.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.210" end="00:30:35.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s the hardest stone the royal family</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.910" end="00:30:35.410" style="s2">has.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.910" end="00:30:39.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She might be to do it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.512" end="00:30:45.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That power leak years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.112" end="00:30:45.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It took your sight.</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.112" end="00:30:53.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your eyes survived petrification once.</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.512" end="00:30:53.612" style="s2">It can&#39;t affect them again.</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.912" end="00:30:57.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Breaking the curse could hurt the guide</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.112" end="00:30:57.512" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.012" end="00:31:01.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.312" end="00:31:11.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me in.</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.512" end="00:31:13.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Highness ordered that no one be</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.012" end="00:31:14.612" style="s2">allowed near him.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.312" end="00:31:16.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother,</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.612" end="00:31:19.012" style="s2">you can no longer control the petrifying</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.412" end="00:31:21.112" style="s2">gaze. Renounce your claim and I&#39;ll let</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.012" end="00:31:24.012" style="s2">you turn to stone in peace.</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.112" end="00:31:24.012" style="s2">You&#39;re not worthy.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.212" end="00:31:28.612" style="s2">Then let everyone watch how long you can</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.012" end="00:31:28.612" style="s2">hold out.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.312" end="00:31:34.991" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop!</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.971" end="00:31:34.991" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.412" end="00:31:49.346" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The serpent&#39;s eye core has finally</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.912" end="00:31:50.712" style="s2">awakened to its full power.</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.346" end="00:31:53.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.712" end="00:31:53.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liora, stay back!</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.312" end="00:31:59.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chip,</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.712" end="00:32:05.712" style="s2">Spike, Doze, Munchy,</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.212" end="00:32:05.712" style="s2">Peanut.</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.912" end="00:32:14.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go!</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.112" end="00:32:15.812" style="s2">Stay away from me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.412" end="00:32:18.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everen,</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.812" end="00:32:18.912" style="s2">do you want me to come closer?</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.412" end="00:32:27.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let go.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.512" end="00:32:27.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time you asked me to stay.</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.112" end="00:32:33.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only the air and the guide can enter the</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.212" end="00:32:33.912" style="s2">altar chamber.</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.212" end="00:32:44.013" style="s2">Listen to my voice.</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.313" end="00:32:47.313" style="s2">Breathe with me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.013" end="00:32:47.313" style="s2">Don&#39;t let the curse take over.</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.952" end="00:32:50.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.113" end="00:32:56.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP. YOU CAN&#39;T DESTROY IT.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.513" end="00:32:58.513" style="s2">WITHOUT THE petrifying gaze, how is this</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.413" end="00:33:00.413" style="s2">family supposed to keep the throne?</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.513" end="00:33:02.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;d let every heir die for it?</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.413" end="00:33:05.013" style="s2">That&#39;s the price of our royal house&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.313" end="00:33:05.013" style="s2">survival.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.313" end="00:33:11.222" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The power is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.113" end="00:33:13.242" style="s2">So is the choice.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.222" end="00:33:13.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.113" end="00:33:20.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I renounce my claim to the throne.</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.313" end="00:33:20.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s nice.</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.313" end="00:33:22.713" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.413" end="00:33:29.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COME ON AND BREAK.</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.598" end="00:33:29.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.913" end="00:33:40.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO. IT WAS SUPPOSED TO CHOOSE ME.</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.313" end="00:33:45.283" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.628" end="00:33:46.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.283" end="00:33:49.213" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.513" end="00:33:49.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on to me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.418" end="00:33:58.438" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.813" end="00:34:07.113" style="s2">All of you back.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.913" end="00:34:09.813" style="s2">The royal power</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.113" end="00:34:09.813" style="s2">it&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.113" end="00:34:12.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The elders all saw you try to kill the</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.213" end="00:34:14.913" style="s2">heir.</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.913" end="00:34:16.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without the petrifying GIFT, THE ROYAL</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.913" end="00:34:17.913" style="s2">FAMILY IS NOTHING.</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.213" end="00:34:22.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The royal family should never have</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.913" end="00:34:22.713" style="s2">survived by sacrificing its own.</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.823" end="00:34:34.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.813" end="00:34:36.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.313" end="00:34:36.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lyra?</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.013" end="00:34:42.324" style="s2">Lyria?</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.304" end="00:34:42.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.014" end="00:34:47.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The remaining petrification energy is</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.914" end="00:34:48.914" style="s2">fading.</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.514" end="00:34:50.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going to happen to her?</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.914" end="00:34:52.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep her eyes covered for seven days.</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.814" end="00:34:54.714" style="s2">After that,</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.314" end="00:34:55.369" style="s2">she may be able to see again.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.714" end="00:34:55.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.369" end="00:34:56.614" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.714" end="00:34:59.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.614" end="00:34:59.814" style="s2">will I be able to see you?</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.314" end="00:35:05.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just getting a glass of water.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.814" end="00:35:07.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The doctor told you to rest.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.414" end="00:35:09.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s nothing wrong with my legs.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.314" end="00:35:09.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could fall.</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.214" end="00:35:19.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my water.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.214" end="00:35:22.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyone who takes another sip gets no</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.314" end="00:35:22.014" style="s2">treats today.</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.774" end="00:35:30.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.614" end="00:35:31.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They need to learn how to tie shoes</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.714" end="00:35:35.314" style="s2">properly.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.614" end="00:35:35.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They need to stop causing trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.814" end="00:35:39.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What color is the sky today?</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.914" end="00:35:41.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blue. Clear blue.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.614" end="00:35:42.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the sunset?</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.214" end="00:35:46.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gold, like fire.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.914" end="00:35:46.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Warm, like Chips Red Hot?</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.714" end="00:35:50.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Close enough.</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.914" end="00:35:51.114" style="s2">The princess pushed open the castle</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.614" end="00:35:52.114" style="s2">doors.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.114" end="00:35:53.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too flat.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.114" end="00:35:54.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with it?</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.014" end="00:35:57.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The princess is running for her life.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.414" end="00:35:59.559" style="s2">You sound like you&#39;re reading a menu.</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.014" end="00:36:01.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The dragon let out a terrifying roar.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.559" end="00:36:01.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.414" end="00:36:07.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Liora, I need to inform you of</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.614" end="00:36:10.314" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.914" end="00:36:11.714" style="s2">His Highness&#39;s curse has been broken.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.314" end="00:36:13.914" style="s2">Your contract as his Highness&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.714" end="00:36:16.014" style="s2">caregiver officially ends today. The</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.914" end="00:36:18.114" style="s2">salary and bonus are both in here, paid</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.014" end="00:36:19.614" style="s2">in full, every cent.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.114" end="00:36:20.914" style="s2">It&#39;s enough to open my own massage</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.614" end="00:36:23.314" style="s2">studio. You&#39;ve already chosen a</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.914" end="00:36:26.014" style="s2">location? Yes. Once the bandages come</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.314" end="00:36:26.014" style="s2">off, I&#39;m moving out.</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.514" end="00:36:35.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s free now.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.314" end="00:36:35.814" style="s2">No one gets to force her to stay.</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.414" end="00:36:45.916" style="s2">All of you</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.516" end="00:36:45.916" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.116" end="00:36:50.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These aren&#39;t mine.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.516" end="00:36:55.416" style="s2">You want to come with me?</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.316" end="00:37:00.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who gave you permission to touch my</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.616" end="00:37:00.116" style="s2">things?</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.816" end="00:37:04.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They packed them on their own.</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.216" end="00:37:08.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The contract is over. You can leave</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.116" end="00:37:08.816" style="s2">whenever you like.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.616" end="00:37:12.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you want me to go?</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.616" end="00:37:16.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re free now.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.916" end="00:37:21.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand. I&#39;ll leave tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.216" end="00:37:33.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop rushing me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.216" end="00:37:37.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everin, I know you&#39;re out there.</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.116" end="00:37:40.516" style="s2">Come here.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.816" end="00:37:46.716" style="s2">You&#39;ll see light first, then shapes.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.916" end="00:37:53.516" style="s2">It&#39;s so bright.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.816" end="00:37:53.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you see?</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.716" end="00:38:01.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you hiding your face?</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.516" end="00:38:01.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The light&#39;s too bright.</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.516" end="00:38:10.316" style="s2">Open your eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.916" end="00:38:15.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you afraid?</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.696" end="00:38:24.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.916" end="00:38:27.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do I look funny to you?</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.316" end="00:38:31.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s what you look like.</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.316" end="00:38:31.016" style="s2">I had no idea you were this handsome.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.451" end="00:38:37.616" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.216" end="00:38:39.916" style="s2">But your hair really does need some</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.616" end="00:38:39.916" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.691" end="00:38:43.916" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.216" end="00:38:44.816" style="s2">My massage studio is going right here.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.916" end="00:38:45.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I could buy the whole street.</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.816" end="00:38:46.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I want to do this on</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.917" end="00:38:47.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; my own.</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.917" end="00:38:49.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Suit yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.617" end="00:38:51.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look closer. It&#39;s 10 minutes from the</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.517" end="00:38:53.117" style="s2">estate.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.117" end="00:38:54.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The location is acceptable.</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.117" end="00:38:56.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your tail seems more impressed than you</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.617" end="00:39:00.017" style="s2">are. Your Highness, the old contract</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.917" end="00:39:00.017" style="s2">needs your final approval.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.117" end="00:39:02.617" style="s2">You really don&#39;t need a caregiver</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.317" end="00:39:05.817" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.617" end="00:39:05.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; don&#39;t need a caregiver.</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.517" end="00:39:11.117" style="s2">But I do need you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.317" end="00:39:13.017" style="s2">Not because of the curse,</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.117" end="00:39:15.517" style="s2">not because of the contract, because</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.017" end="00:39:17.417" style="s2">you&#39;re Liora.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.517" end="00:39:20.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your heart rate&#39;s climbing again. Looks</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.417" end="00:39:20.717" style="s2">like your long-term monitoring.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.317" end="00:39:27.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chip.</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.852" end="00:39:29.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.317" end="00:39:40.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grand opening special, 20% off every</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.017" end="00:39:40.917" style="s2">treatment today.</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.617" end="00:39:47.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what?</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.717" end="00:39:49.717" style="s2">My back feels fine all of a sudden.</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.217" end="00:39:53.117" style="s2">You&#39;re here here now. Might as well.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.717" end="00:39:58.317" style="s2">Can&#39;t waste a 20% discount.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.117" end="00:39:58.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;LL PAY FULL PRICE. JUST LET ME GO.</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.717" end="00:40:04.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; APPOINTMENTS REQUIRED for everyone</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.417" end="00:40:06.717" style="s2">except his Highness. His Highness wrote</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.017" end="00:40:06.717" style="s2">it himself.</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.617" end="00:40:20.117" style="s2">Lifetime member?</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.717" end="00:40:20.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I intend to be your first client.</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.117" end="00:40:26.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.117" end="00:40:29.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your exclusive lifetime member</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.617" end="00:40:29.217" style="s2">treatment.</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.017" end="00:40:36.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fully recovered.</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.217" end="00:40:36.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did you buy a membership?</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.917" end="00:40:47.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m only here for the hugs.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.417" end="00:40:49.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hugs cost extra.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.017" end="00:40:49.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much?</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.217" end="00:40:52.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Free</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.418" end="00:40:52.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; for lifetime members.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.718" end="00:40:59.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We haven&#39;t even gone in yet.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.218" end="00:41:06.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your neck and shoulders are still tight.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.218" end="00:41:13.518" style="s2">You need a deep tissue session.</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.518" end="00:41:14.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Add one clause to the lifetime contract.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.518" end="00:41:17.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.918" end="00:41:19.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more maximum pressure treatments</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.818" end="00:41:22.118" style="s2">ever.</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.718" end="00:41:22.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.418" end="00:41:34.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lyra, what&#39;s that sound?</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.518" end="00:41:37.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A complimentary service for lifetime</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.918" end="00:41:37.618" style="s2">members.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
